(1) Clearance between skirt and steps (Section 6.1.3.3.5 or Section 6.2.3.3.5(a), and Section 6.2.3.3.6(a)).
(2) Height above step (Section 6.1.3.3.6(a) or Section 6.2.3.3.5(b), and Section 6.2.3.3.6(b)).
(3) Deflection (Section 6.1.3.3.6(b) or Section 6.2.3.3.6(c)).
